        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana RNB, Stainless Steel 4 Inch Modern House Numbers</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern 4 Inch Address Numbers can be mounted flush or floating by using the included stand-offs. The Stainless Steel 4 Inch Modern House Numbers are available in either Brushed Stainless or Matte Black finish colors. Each one is 4 inches tall with a 11/16 inch projection. The Deltana Series B House Numbers come packaged with surface mount hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/modern-4-inch-address-letters-deltana-rnb-letters\"><b>Address Letters</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Deltana Modern Font Address Numbers:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .275\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware for surface mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Can be mounted flush or floating.</li>\r\n<li>There are variances in height for specific digits. Please <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-RNB-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262418\" target=\"new\"><b>CLICK HERE to see the specifications of each number (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-RNB-finishes.jpg?v=1704354668\" width=\"394\" height=\"190\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana RNE Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
